        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana KS10, Classic Beauty Square Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Classic Beauty Square Cabinet Knob has an elegance that is perfect for transitional homes. This cabinet knob can easily be installed on kitchen drawers and doors as well as anywhere a small knob is utilized, such as on furniture and bi-fold closet doors. Add class to your home with the 1-3/16 Inch Square Cabinet Knob.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-KS10-speifications.gif?v=1704354585\" width=\"527\" height=\"225\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana KS10 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Square Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length : 1-3/16\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 3/4\" square</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-KS10-specifications.pdf?v=1704262367\"><b>Deltana KS10 Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
